ion before creating an installation, ensuring that its system-side effects belong only to disposable CI machines."},{"markdown":"Real CLI invocations reject lexical or symlink escapes, outside reports and populated roots before provisioning, so genuine fresh installation cannot reuse or modify unrelated state.","startLine":87,"endLine":87,"text":"Real CLI invocations reject lexical or symlink escapes, outside reports and populated roots before provisioning, so genuine fresh installation cannot reuse or modify unrelated state."},{"markdown":"Windows x64 and Linux x64 jobs require validated candidate provenance, exact tooling checkout, the managed installer runner and retained failure evidence under read-only GitHub permissions.","startLine":91,"endLine":91,"text":"Windows x64 and Linux x64 jobs require validated candidate provenance, exact tooling checkout, the managed installer runner and retained failure evidence under read-only GitHub permissions."},{"markdown":"An actual POSIX child ignores SIGTERM after its parent exits. Timeout handling awaits bounded process-group cleanup, escalates to SIGKILL and checks for survivors before returning the original timeout failure.","startLine":95,"endLine":95,"text":"An actual POSIX child ignores SIGTERM after its parent exits. Timeout handling awaits bounded process-group cleanup, escalates to SIGKILL and checks for survivors before returning the original timeout failure."},{"markdown":"A real Python subprocess executes the generated minimal probe with tiny dependency fixtures, checking output, home, quoted argv and its missing-stdout guard.","startLine":99,"endLine":99,"text":"A real Python subprocess executes the generated minimal probe with tiny dependency fixtures, checking output, home, quoted argv and its missing-stdout guard."},{"markdown":"The generated web probe preserves original stdout across redirection; stderr never substitutes for raw output.","startLine":101,"endLine":101,"text":"The generated web probe preserves original stdout across redirection; stderr never substitutes for raw output."},{"markdown":"Dispatch selects all checks by default, or only native desktop installation/update or managed Agent provisioning; candidate provenance validation always runs.","startLine":105,"endLine":105,"text":"Dispatch selects all checks by default, or only native desktop installation/update or managed Agent provisioning; candidate provenance validation always runs."},{"markdown":"The dispatch choice scopes concurrency, allowing a managed-only diagnostic run alongside native acceptance for the same candidate. Selection changes only which independent CI jobs execute; it does not weaken their checks or rebuild the candidate.","startLine":107,"endLine":107,"text":"The dispatch choice scopes concurrency, allowing a managed-only diagnostic run alongside native acceptance for the same candidate. Selection changes only which independent CI jobs execute; it does not weaken their checks or rebuild the candidate."},{"markdown":"The workflow exposes the three supported targets, keeps the provenance gate unconditional, and routes native and managed jobs with separate choice-aware concurrency keys.","startLine":111,"endLine":111,"text":"The workflow exposes the three supported targets, keeps the provenance gate unconditional, and routes native and managed jobs with separate choice-aware concurrency keys."}],"blocks":[{"type":"heading","start":0,"end":27,"startLine":1,"endLine":1,"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","start":29,"end":209,"startLine":3,"endLine":3,"children":[]},{"type":"heading","start":211,"end":244,"startLine":5,"endLine":5,"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","start":246,"end":429,"startLine":7,"endLine":7,"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","start":431,"end":886,"startLine":9,"endLine":9,"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","start":888,"end":1124,"startLine":11,"endLine":11,"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","start":1126,"end":1382,"startLine":13,"endLine":13,"children":[]},{"type":"pa